# Tawnos's Coffin exiles a Warrior token enchanted by Holy Strength. The token ceases to exist in exile, so when the
# Coffin untaps no card returns, and "if you do" leaves Holy Strength exiled forever (the ruling; CR 111.7, 603.7c).
[Bot1 Deck]
Tawnos's Coffin
Gleemox
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Island
Secure the Wastes
Holy Strength
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30

